#: scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe113b846b3ff44668d65026bb34c9d0f73578eb40a5a2edbf2ca68a7431eb2b
#. default-sha256: 1304cef1bf324d571f865f097c48e71a999fce1b1c54ac63a99ea8e7a2761cac
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I didn’t really "
"understand Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫在我看来，⟪k:14⟫米歇尔总"
"是让人无法理解。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a740f643b8bd53734670a97bb7645df84a0bcb56a7d0fdfd1ba2a8a5a8cf2dd9
#. default-sha256: 83e938a58cf43f20403e0106505da846efd68d138feddccc0a4b638d17c65abc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that was probably because we were still essentially strangers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不过，⟪k:1⟫那一定只是互相间还不太熟悉的缘故吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc625c7aa54f158a0d0aaceb8c90d57f6723bb4fffb8bbb9574fad71af01f9e7
#. default-sha256: e8a79ee7c0dfc253ddc26e7aa166b7df5f32d896639c92f90eb43a8cbb7ce9b7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having been sent to the mansion as reparation for my mistakes,⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t sure who I might "
"find there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我是为了「赎罪」才被送来这座馆的。⟪k:1⟫所以，⟪k:2⟫会不自觉地想「等着我的会是什么样的人」呢……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc6230768041d3ae24a37172767914a1151f051aaff330e88945e396ab32eb89
#. default-sha256: 352078269bc4f74619be9d92a51cab6747d82761c24992c31cec62d2aa0063fb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but I was tentatively convinced he wasn’t a ⟪k:1⟫terrible⟪k:2⟫ person.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He didn’t do "
"anything to me—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫except stay away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不过现在看来，⟪k:1⟫米歇尔并非是如我所担心的那种粗暴的人。⟪k:2⟫他并没有干涉我太多，⟪k:3⟫只是和"
"我保持着距离而已。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 049d83817f0371e1e9fe34b646e4513b8ad3d1a01d7d9c1a903d27b1fced374b
#. default-sha256: b4e816016ec91c3fa302d79bba279c3586277c223b4448c11a9c8882321569e4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his time in his chambers,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大部分的时间，他似乎都会把自己关在卧室里。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e94db5308d143250efd01a661e9b4d90eb2435009972dbe483b1c64c072d2cb0
#. default-sha256: dd0ccfc9ab088c8f0e490f41278e5a1c050eb561d500f22991420caaf784a3b8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫which he had told me to never enter under any circumstances,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫还曾警告过我，⟪k:1⟫绝对不可以进入那间卧室。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eacb5d0822571bd0a578490a1fad0c99b13422ca839ed749e7ee862eb8137eab
#. default-sha256: 6162d2a51c7a414302ba7ea6ff4f04345d36fa93090ac6c7aa3c358fdf8d58da
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we rarely encountered one another in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，就算同处一个屋檐下，也没有碰面的机会。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 278f1efbb47a1c96328382cbc64c0ae6fda17c6b350068972df4f3e1c0bdbc00
#. default-sha256: ea998d0ede299fa64f15e6f7d18dfe2ca7470a58feb94126d4e675cbedf16b3b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For that reason, I made an effort to be kind and cheerful on the sporadic occasions we ⟪k:1⟫"
"did⟪k:2⟫ cross paths."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但也正因为如此——⟪k:1⟫偶尔遇上他的时候。⟪k:2⟫我想表现得更开朗一些。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e87aa614f8e9f6b61bb073a081b526efc53f5a642c4d8dd4dcaf49abf32dbb0c
#. default-sha256: aeb34d833ec64430a4fc4f2d4849b310eb1a1b3b9a4735108cf5f524392f2679
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I figured if I kept that up long enough,⟪k:1⟫he would eventually warm up to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这样的话——⟪k:1⟫或许就能打开他的心扉。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39d651d90e028d38462645af695aeda4555310a4edb295f1fc8fcbf4a18ba3f8
#. default-sha256: da389add928cb58c777af856e6e8f73fab0f5adeff41180d77da131a94d15a68
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as new housemates, being able to enjoy our time together was obviously preferable to the "
"alternative."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫毕竟难得才在同一屋檐下嘛，⟪k:1⟫肯定是开开心心地生活比较好啊。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97b331a7b023c780d97e1260dc7c5394c980da8e5df714d3f3c74f804e204b18
#. default-sha256: 3663de04b00793a3bb1663edc1fc15214be796dc02bbf02f97d05045440b1de4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I did manage to break the ice, I hoped we would be able to do some talking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"about the mansion, about him, about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫如果他敞开了心扉的话……⟪k:1⟫一定能聊许多话题吧。⟪k:2⟫比如这座馆的事啦，⟪k:3⟫关于他的事啦，"
"⟪k:4⟫关于我的事啦。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3a5241c394ec02aa183c964712942207a6f422657e6cdd4c790ff7025c546f1
#. default-sha256: 8e7d2b34188584c388f3d7043112e59ad5f41b38ba10fc780980b08d8d8f28e0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just had to keep working at it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫于是我在心里默念着——这一天到来之前，得好好加油才行。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4dc87d14e254872b986a0b647f7d66aeca610f5067839dec17b67f33f356664
#. default-sha256: 4540d643f40efb2b36db577457f9fee4e06873f64dc81a95852d49cd5de3cb68
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel didn’t need me to take care of him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He handled his own day-to-day needs "
"and activities by himself,⟪k:4⟫and in fact, he didn’t ask me for anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫但……⟪k:2⟫他总表现出不需要我照顾他起居的态度。⟪k:3⟫说到底，⟪k:4⟫他并不信赖我，⟪k:5⟫基本都"
"是独立完成自己的事。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43c881c63ec8b5d475414591850c4bf6eae92f278c05fef0c652fd0e0f165c23
#. default-sha256: d14349a5be98160bb7eeb6db4168a1111493e63c675502134dcea859adfea00d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An aristocrat who had no use for his servant—⟪k:1⟫I hadn’t met anyone like him before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不使唤佣人的贵族。⟪k:1⟫这种人我还是头一次遇到。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 697d7f22c5b303fb53b8757b69047e5592a65faf13e1ef6ebc3b1e7cf316ca57
#. default-sha256: 95ff4025dd3b0eee3732a1c9280591279c3ac75132ffd7ace9833d376298fb2d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All right, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………好吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e03c6c02fe63fc291a84d367f81c8bd73009752bb5835cec578afd163791782
#. default-sha256: 187b4f50cf6dcf30d98a40c64ccbb18ebec5ee8fb57a8ee6c6d26cd89630d6f6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That meant about all I could do was clean."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因此，⟪k:1⟫我能干的，⟪k:2⟫只剩下类似打扫房间之类的活了。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a45eeb7441229be64bf33000fdd0e4dd07fab20a28fa7e53c6a50f2ca9a2e056
#. default-sha256: 26c9f23f6c79dc230d9159bb6fa2254bb344675c515a49acf5a61257de839954
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure how his room looked,⟪k:1⟫but the rest of the house was, quite frankly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说不清楚他的卧室是何模样，⟪k:1⟫但看其他房间，⟪k:2⟫说实话……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9527936e59aa0ea37477967a66709dd16f70584f5c1fb784a6c6e58f0d0a5c1a
#. default-sha256: f36b32775369d17e2f6a91c97fb7f1e8cb4708b90278bc0f5fbf9cb6c245c828
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫an absolute disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫实在很糟糕。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4df7e082778a1c57adb09bf81d72fa51e763852e6c813eb34eec69086d72d759
#. default-sha256: 3d03809a0a251042771812825bdbb050fc03fdb9354f1ef5393de9c714b1f5d6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The dust was so heavy it was obvious it hadn’t been touched in years."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是长年不打扫的缘故吧，⟪k:1⟫满房间都是灰尘。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 297af41c73d99a34f2dfdcf73dfc9dc97a98ad3909b275a658763872a720c319
#. default-sha256: b582dd99237bff309ebc4cfe8ade791cf5376092b1dcbbb09a806990fc71591c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Let’s get started!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫要开干了哦……！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc63c80ee04b2b8e1afd258e059613f7930895bdbe51084be38e4a4aa80b3668
#. default-sha256: da136084e2c136e7fc8e06b1f2f6eb3da8fa10fff09c7691652b19511d6fb5e1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It couldn’t be healthy to live in these conditions, so I set out to clean each room in the "
"house one by one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这种卫生状况实在不堪。⟪k:1⟫所以我从自己的房间开始，⟪k:2⟫逐间逐间清扫起屋子来。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2d53bfd4d387379fd41ee6fbac297ec5183f2ebbf2cd242c464734ef895bafe
#. default-sha256: 311d6b90912023e97b10fcff861343b49a19c32fe7eb09848910c4e2b27b7413
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, it wasn’t going to be an easy task."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫这份差事的确够辛苦的。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8acfdd67bb5516eefebc28e515d9c8bcffa80662cc857bfacca29921fc2e05c1
#. default-sha256: a3411bfb8e854df3dba9aa33cf888d63ca8860439a8c666efda81d272b8535b9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not because I was bad at cleaning—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in fact, I considered myself quite good at it—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫并非因为我不习惯清扫。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫相对来说，⟪k:3⟫我做这个还算是得心应手，但是——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfbf3ae517abd104bb7e4ab38ca84635e4f84b271832036e674a8e6137c7593c
#. default-sha256: 640839692ebc979c26b2608073059fb5c9f2cd817be22d6b878af6a8bad1e7cf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but because it was near impossible to find all the dust and grime that needed cleaning under "
"the flickering light of a candle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那些用来照明的烛台，⟪k:1⟫只能提供零丁的烛火光源。⟪k:2⟫指望借助这这点光亮清扫干净屋子的角角落"
"落，⟪k:3⟫简直是难上加难。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c1017d3f8aa0e62eeedc0823e887aa58e4172be5c3b40507d96d9b15716b31c
#. default-sha256: 4fad0a39150ab26b29d87a7ca9a3e3616b8d7c672f5f7367b4c87dc6b70b6c8c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can’t understand how anyone sane can live in this dark.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What’s wrong with him?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫况且在如此漆黑的环境下生活，⟪k:1⟫就不是正常人的做法。⟪k:2⟫那个人到底在想些什么啊……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f280b0315db7b5f54e7e3e3cb11631af2e47517a11d28be172796347af612ac1
#. default-sha256: c2fb747dc557a89f84facfc9a706d6c6787b277d4cd74dd986e52fb5b4fd2e9b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maybe... ⟪k:1⟫he’s actually a vampire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫或许，⟪k:1⟫他……是类似吸血鬼之类的存在吗？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CE48C0B_1CCE_4B76_9C3C_186F60FDDC5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebb0eeb2531f1d9ad38da5cc6db0870b848d29aa0f43ee704835b08bd2a39c54
